{
  "_comment": "GT-Alarm icon manifest. Each icon: name (output stem), glyph (Tabler file), variant (outline|filled), mode (raw|grad|circle), paint (key into palette.colors for raw, palette.gradients otherwise), size (px), out (android|watch). Optional src: a vendored non-Tabler SVG path (relative to icongen/, e.g. iconify/*.svg) already colored — overrides the Tabler glyph lookup and skips paint mutation. See README.md.",
  "palette": {
